  "releaseNotes": "v1.9.0: Adds native pure-C# Thinking Machines Lab Inkling-2-Mini (24->48 looped MoE) engine with D3D12 HLSL compute shaders (NVIDIA & AMD UMA), AVX-512BW INT8-activation NVFP4 CPU fallback, official Inkling-2 control tokens (200000..200057), <=16 MB batched SWA/ShortConv prefix checkpointing, and Inkling2HeadLoraAdapter runtime support.",
